WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.345
Ever cleaned your entire room

00:00:01.360 --> 00:00:02.885
to avoid one email?

00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:04.600
The email takes five minutes.

00:00:04.720 --> 00:00:06.720
Suddenly, your kitchen needs forty.

00:00:07.100 --> 00:00:08.675
Sometimes, the easier task

00:00:08.690 --> 00:00:10.230
offers a clear finish.

00:00:10.450 --> 00:00:11.265
The important one

00:00:11.280 --> 00:00:12.470
brings uncertainty.

00:00:12.940 --> 00:00:14.110
What if they say no?

00:00:14.280 --> 00:00:15.240
So try this:

00:00:15.550 --> 00:00:16.630
open the draft.

00:00:17.060 --> 00:00:18.465
Write one messy sentence.

00:00:18.480 --> 00:00:19.740
You don't have to send it yet.

00:00:19.960 --> 00:00:21.650
The goal isn't a perfect email.

00:00:21.730 --> 00:00:22.535
It's a first move

00:00:22.550 --> 00:00:23.820
you can actually make.

00:00:24.160 --> 00:00:25.405
What's the five-minute task

00:00:25.420 --> 00:00:26.370
you've been avoiding?
